# CSC Analyzer

A professional Python-based tool for analyzing Common Service Center (CSC) transaction data. This project helps users process, analyze, and generate reports from CSC datasets efficiently.

---

## 📌 Features

* 📂 Load CSC transaction data from CSV files
* 🧹 Data cleaning and preprocessing
* 📊 Transaction summary and analytics
* 📈 Generate reports with charts and statistics
* 💾 Export processed results to CSV
* ⚡ Fast and easy-to-use command-line interface

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* Python 3.x
* Pandas
* NumPy
* Matplotlib
* CSV

