## 🚀 Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/mohammadyounus4949-netizen/CSC-Analyzer.git
```

Go to the project folder:

```bash
cd CSC-Analyzer
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## ▶️ Usage

Run the project:

```bash
python csc_analyzer.py
```

Follow the on-screen instructions to analyze the CSC dataset.

